<Step ID="5" Task="By the Riesz representation theorem, what vector $z$ satisfies $\phi(u) = \langle u, z \rangle$ for all $u$ in the span of $\{v_x\}$? What is $||z||$?" Difficulty="6" Token="70" Rely="4"/>
